      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Cronin Wall Properties are delighted to bring 18 Riverside Estate, Midleton to the market. This beautiful 3-bedroom mid-terrace home offers an excellent opportunity for for those seeking a property in a popular and well-established residential location. The property enjoys a bright and welcoming feel throughout, with well-proportioned rooms and plenty of potential for a new owner to put their own stamp on the home. Riverside Estate is a mature residential development within walking distance to Midleton town center, where an excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, sporting facilities and everyday amenities can be found. This is an opportunity not to be missed. Viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the potential and location of this property.\r\n\r\nAccommodation consists of: Entrance Hall, Living Room, Kitchen/Dining Room, Utility Room, Guest W.C, 3 Bedroom's & Bathroom\r\n\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway 1.77m x 4.67m\r\nSolid wood flooring, radiator, lighting\r\n\r\n\r\nLiving Room 3.23m x 4.87m\r\nSolid wood flooring, radiator, light fitting, fireplace\r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen 3.51m x 3.93m\r\nTiled flooring, shaker style kitchen units, gas hob, oven, fridge/freezer, lighting, back door leading to rear garden\r\n\r\n\r\nUtility Room 1.20m x 2.25m\r\nTiled flooring, washing machine, dryer\r\n\r\n\r\nDining Room 5.04m x 3.38m\r\nSolid wood flooring, built-in units, fireplace, lighting\r\n\r\n\r\nGuest W.C\r\nTiled flooring, w.c, w.h.b, wall mounted mirror, lighting\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 2.65m x 2.89m\r\nWood effect flooring, double bed, radiator, lighting, built in wardrobe\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 2.86m x 4.17m\r\nWood effect flooring, double bed, built-in wardrobe radiator, lighting\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3- 2.27m x 3.25m\r\nWood effect flooring, built-in single bed, radiator, lighting\r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom - 1.86m x 1.93m\r\nTiled flooring & walls, w.c, w.h.b, shower, wall mounted mirror, lighting\r\n\r\n\r\nRear Garden\r\nFully enclosed rear garden. Paved patio area, steel-tech shed, back gate access to car parking"
      },
